{"unit_id":"liceses__dsh-gitbash-preset#card-zh","repo":"liceses/dsh-gitbash-preset","commit":"6e873bb6a1ee3add78f8e2ecce42dabaeb445e09","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Git Bash preset 为 Windows DSH 网页端极简模式提供 Git Bash 命令执行。插件启动时将预设文件复制到用户目录；选择后，bash 工具通过会话内 shell 服务运行 Git Bash，并提供 str_replace_editor。执行器可自动探测或指定 bash.exe，处理工作目录、超时、输出限制、取消及 MSYS 盘符路径转换。每条命令使用新 shell，需安装 Git for Windows；受限沙箱模式下命令会被拒绝。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:48-73","agent-presets/minimal-gitbash/agent.cordis.yml:26-70","agent-presets/minimal-gitbash/gitbash-executor.mjs:83-117","agent-presets/minimal-gitbash/gitbash-executor.mjs:213-346"]}
