{"unit_id":"liceses__dsh-gitbash-preset#feature-1","repo":"liceses/dsh-gitbash-preset","commit":"6e873bb6a1ee3add78f8e2ecce42dabaeb445e09","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"功能「Git Bash 命令执行」：将 DSH 预设中的 bash 工具连接到会话内 shell 服务，每次命令通过 Git Bash 的 -c 参数启动独立进程，并收集输出。","source":"generated","evidence":["agent-presets/minimal-gitbash/agent.cordis.yml:26-52","agent-presets/minimal-gitbash/gitbash-executor.mjs:213-242"]}
