{"unit_id":"liceses__dsh-gitbash-preset#feature-5","repo":"liceses/dsh-gitbash-preset","commit":"6e873bb6a1ee3add78f8e2ecce42dabaeb445e09","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"功能「安装用户预设」：插件启动时将打包的预设文件复制到 DSH 用户预设目录；已有安装默认跳过，可配置 force 覆盖包内文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:27-73"]}
{"unit_id":"liceses__dsh-gitbash-preset#caveat-1","repo":"liceses/dsh-gitbash-preset","commit":"6e873bb6a1ee3add78f8e2ecce42dabaeb445e09","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"使用前须知：命令执行器会在非完全访问的沙箱模式下拒绝运行；每条命令都会启动新 shell，因此 cd 和环境变量不会跨调用保留。","source":"generated","evidence":["agent-presets/minimal-gitbash/gitbash-executor.mjs:213-242","agent-presets/minimal-gitbash/agent.cordis.yml:45-52"]}
